Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev/)

Five icon designs from the Lucide icon set are reproduced as inline SVG
markup in src/lib/theme/components/ModalHierarchyPill.svelte: Person
Standing, Bike, Tram Front, Car, and Truck. None of these five are part
of Lucide's Feather-derived subset, so only the ISC License below applies
to this usage. Full license: https://lucide.dev/license

Eight more Lucide icons are used as CSS mask images in
src/lib/theme/styles/base.css: Info, Lightbulb, Triangle Alert and Octagon
Alert on the callout labels (Note, Tip, Caution, Danger), and Target,
Chart Column, Hammer and Landmark on the Retrofit Strategy fact cards.
Some of these (Info, Triangle Alert, Octagon Alert, Target) descend from
Feather icons, so the MIT License notice for Feather below applies to
them as well as the ISC License.

