ColorSym (https://colorsym.com/, https://github.com/luisfrancisco/colorsym)

Five ColorSym symbols (red, yellow, blue, green, violet) by Chris Eastridge
and Luis Francisco are used, unmodified, as background images in
src/lib/theme/styles/color-symbols.css, from static/color-symbols/. They
mark colored cards when a reader turns on "Color symbols" in Display
settings. The symbols are licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/); the full text is in
static/color-symbols/LICENSE-CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt. The separator
(static/color-symbols/slash.svg) was drawn for this publication. Credit is
also shown on /about/brand-guide/.

